    "animal_or_pet_question": "This question is outside the indexed human asthma guideline scope. Please consult a qualified veterinarian or relevant professional.",
    "clearly_non_clinical": "This question is outside the indexed asthma guideline scope. I can only answer clinical questions that are supported by the official asthma guideline documents.",
